      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RINGBARK GUS (1) flew the lids with a strong early split and led throughout to score an impressive win by 2.25 lengths over 350m at this track (19.06). Great chance to get the job done again. STAR FERNANDO (2) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Q Lakeside over 457m behind No Source Found (26.03) in a Restricted WIN. Was in the money prior to that. Can do much better this time. VELOCITY SMOLDER (3) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 18.93 beating Wolf Thunder. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Expecting another bold showing. SPRING RORY (7) is new to this track but not to be underestimated.",
